<title>HONDURAS: Honduras weekly coffee export update - IHCAFE.</title>
<headline>Honduras weekly coffee export update - IHCAFE.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA, Honduras 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduran Coffee Institute updated coffee exports and sales to Aug 15 in the 1996-1997 Oct-Sept cycle. Figures are in 46-kg bags, known as quintals. 1995-1996 figures are updated to the same date.</p>
<p>    Transactions	   1995-1996	  1996-1997     Change</p>
<p>    Registered Purchases 2,480,788	  2,616,748    135,960</p>
<p>    Registered Sales     2,680,138	  2,391,437   -288,701</p>
<p>    Exports		  2,648,154	  2,372,355   -275,800</p>
<p>    Forecast		  Estimated	  Executed    Percent</p>
<p>    Registered		2,750,000	 2,616,748    95.15</p>
<p>    Internal Consumption    219,050	   214,265    97.82</p>
<p>    Exports		   2,557,500	 2,372,355    92.76</p>
<p>((--Tegucigalpa bureau +504 39 28 85))</p>
</text>
